1b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m I'm adding one small engine change so the world can list its save names, then moving through the Manifest,\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmeasurements, bundle run, gates and docs. First\u001b[51GI'm\u001b[55Gchecking\u001b[64Gthe\u001b[68Gtest\u001b[73Ghelpers,\u001b[82GDocker\u001b[89Gand\u001b[93Gfree\u001b[98Gmemory.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m*\u001b[3GDoodling… \u001b[39G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthought for 28s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
