[0.099, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m  \u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mr works\u001b[19Greams wait until the user\u001b[45Ghas played the first loop for a day or two.                          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 76 \u001b[22m Follow [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mgame integration\u001b[39m](game-integration.md) and inspect Manifest's current development-stage/gamepla\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22my requirements before each task.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m77\u001b[11G\u001b[22mProvis\u001b[18Gon their reusable engine capabilities\u001b[56Ghere;\u001b[62Gproduction\u001b[73Grules\u001b[79Gand\u001b[83Gcontent\u001b[91Gstay\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m8\u001b[11G\u001b[22min Man\u001b[18Gfes\u001b[22G. Retain the small space exampl\u001b[54G as a se\u001b[63Garate automat\u001b[77Gd-test consumer.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  (another command ran in this repository at the same time; a change made by either may show under either \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mresult)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mEngine\u001b[10Ggate\u001b[15Gpassed\u001b[22G(294\u001b[27Gs).\u001b[31GCommitting\u001b[42Gthe\u001b[46Gprovision\u001b[56Gso\u001b[59GManifest\u001b[68Gcan\u001b[72Gpin\u001b[76Git.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+16\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, ran \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mEngine\u001b[10Gcommitted\u001b[20Gas\u001b[23G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m13c1bec\u001b[39m.\u001b[32GChecking\u001b[41Ghow\u001b[45GManifest\u001b[54Gfetches\u001b[62Gthe\u001b[66Gpin,\u001b[71Gsince\u001b[77Ga\u001b[79Gremote\u001b[86GURL\u001b[90Gwould\u001b[96Gneed\u001b[101Gthe\u001b[105Gpush\u001b[110Gfirs