[0.096, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 789 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  restore does not; a restore checks every file's checksum before it writes one. Not done.            \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 790 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- **Durability** is held to the writer's seam and `WriteFileDurably`'s order, and to a process killed \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 791 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  outright; no power cut was tested.                                                                  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 792 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- **The TUI** retries nothing (R08), and `test-bundle.sh` needs Docker and is run by hand.            \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 793 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- **Debug files**: a release's binaries keep theirs, as R07 left them.                                \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 794 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 795 \u001b[22m ## Commit model:\u001b[29Gdurable step batches\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 796 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 797 \u001b[12G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[16Gproposal\u001b[25Gof\u001b[28G2026-11-15,\u001b[40Gkept\u001b[45Gas\u001b[48Git\u001b[51Gwas\u001b[55Gmade.\u001b[61GIts\u001b[65Gcommit\u001b[72Gbefore\u001b[79Gexecution\u001b[89Gand\u001b[93Gits\u001b[97Gdurable\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m...\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 982 \u001b[12G\u001b[22mStage\u001b[18G5\u001b[20Gcompletes\u001b[30Gwhen\u001b[35Gacknowledged\u001b[48Gcommands\u001b[57Gsurvive\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gtested\u001b[76Gcrash\u001b[82Gboundaries,\u001b[94Gretries\r\u001b[1B