[0.025, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[8G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m8\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfirst definition that\u001b[33Gdiffers, and\u001b[46Ga pruned\u001b[55Grequ\u001b[60Gst s\u001b[65Gquence is \u001b[77Gld too\u001b[84Gold acro\u001b[93Gs \u001b[96G load. The\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m9\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mbundle passed on Lythir and in Ubuntu 24.04 and\u001b[59GDebian 13. The R\u001b[76Glease figures are record\u001b[102G: \u001b[105G flush  \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m10\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mholds\u001b[17Gthe server's loop about 11 ms,\u001b[48Ga s\u001b[52Gapshot about 60. Save\u001b[75Gare to leave\u001b[88Gthe \u001b[93Gtep's thread \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m11\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mD-115\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](decision-ledger.md#d-115)), not yet built. The later workstreams (L01 onwards) wait until the \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m2\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242muser has played the first loop for a\u001b[48Gday or two; W22 waits for the first larger hull.  \u001b[99G      \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m3\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 14 \u001b[22m R08 is done: [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mreconnect and recovery\u001b[39m](stage-5-recovery-plan.md#reconnect-and-recovery-r08-2026-11-24),\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 15 \u001b[22m on pin `d9f565c` with no engine edit, in tests alone. The `remote` suite crashes a journalled server\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\u001b[11G\u001b[22munder thre\u001b[22G clients and reconnects them: what the journa\u001b[68G kept is a\u001b[79Gswered from th\u001b[94G ledger, what it\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mCommitting the close,\u001b[25Gthen\u001b[30Ggating\u001b[37Git\u001b[40Gin\u001b[43G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbuild/gate-tree\u001b[59G\u001b[39mwith\u001b[64G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--tidy\u001b[71G\u001b[39mat\u001b[74G24\u001b[77Gworkers.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+19\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, ran \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mWhile the Manifest gate runs I'm only\u001b[41Gediting: marking R09\u001b[62Gdone\u001b[67Gin\u001b[70GJettison's\u001b[81Groadmap\u001b[89Gand\u001b[93Ghistory,\u001b[102Gand\u001b[106Greading\u001b[114Gboth\r\u001b[1B  repositories' CI workflows.\u001b[K\r\u001b[77C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mought for 3s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
