[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[11Got or\u001b[17Gbackup holds a\u001b[32Gs\u001b[34Gep or a frame: the\u001b[53Gfiles are written durably beside \u001b[87Ghe loop,\u001b[96Gth\u001b[99G catalo\u001b[107Gue\u001b[110Gpubl\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bished only \u001b[23Gnce\u001b[27Gwhat i\u001b[34G names is on disk, and the\u001b[61Gserialising\u001b[73Gitself brough\u001b[88Gunder\u001b[94Ga step's budget as t\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bhe world grows. Until then a flush holds the loop about 11 m\u001b[72G and a snapshot about 60 against a \u001b[108G6.7 ms\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B step | [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mStage 5 close\u001b[39m](stage-5-recovery-plan.md#stage-5-closed-\u001b[76G09-2026-11-25) | select\u001b[100Gd 2026-11-25,\u001b[K\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bthe user's; not yet built\u001b[37G|\u001b[39Gboth,\u001b[45Gwhen\u001b[50Ga\u001b[52Gworld\u001b[58Goutgrows\u001b[67Ga\u001b[69Gstep\u001b[74Gor\u001b[77Ga\u001b[79Gframe\u001b[85Gis\u001b[88Gdrawn\u001b[94Gbeside\u001b[101Gone;\u001b[106Ga\u001b[108Greusab\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m le writer is Jettison's |\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m35\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m| <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"d-116\"\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m></a>D-116 | CI is not the gate: on a clean Ubuntu 24.04 runner it checks the environmen\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bt'\u001b[14G par\u001b[20Gy, st\u001b[26Gges the distribution's bundle and run\u001b[64G its smoke test outside the dev\u001b[96Glopment shell. Bui\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Blds,\u001b[16Gsuites,\u001b[24Gsanitisers and tidy are the local gate's, run before every push. Supersedes D-007's clang-\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Btidy in CI | [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mBuild and gates: CI\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](build-and-gates.md#verification-evidence) | implemented in `.github/\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bworkflows/ci.yml` (2026-11-25); s\u001b[45Glected 2026-11-25,\u001b[64Gthe\u001b[68Guser's:\u001b[76Gthe\u001b[80Gfull\u001b[85Ggate\u001b[90Gran\u001b[94Gpast\u001b[99Gthe\u001b[103Gjob's\u001b[109Ghour\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m    +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mon every run | Manifest, development workflow |                                                        \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m6\u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[11G\u001b[22m##\u001b[14GProduct\u001b[22Gdirection\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 38 \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Editing ~/projects/manifest/AGENTS.md\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Update(~/projects/manifest/AGENTS.md)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
