[0.072, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m l\u001b[33Gnes\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m71\u001b[11G\u001b[22m  [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116manalysis\u001b[39m](docs/project-analysis-2026-11-16.md#ci-failure-an\u001b[74Glysis--2026-11-16) is historical.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m72\u001b[11G\u001b[22m- **CI runs on `feature-base` pushes, PRs to it and manual dispatch, not on `main` (M02).**\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m73\u001b[11G\u001b[22m  Promote with `scripts/promote.sh`, which fast-forwards `main` only to a\u001b[85Gcommit whose own\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 74 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  `feature-base` run passed. Tidy runs last since M01, so its failure no longer hides Release          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 75 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  and ASan/UBSan results. Name the stages that actually ran; do not describe a tidy-only               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 76 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  failure as a build regression.                                                                       \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m74\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  `featur\u001b[21G-ba\u001b[25Ge` run passe\u001b[38G. CI is no\u001b[49G the g\u001b[56Gte (D-116): it stag\u001b[76Gs the bundle\u001b[89Gand smok\u001b[98G-tests   \u001b[108G      \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m75\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  it\u001b[16Go\u001b[19GUbuntu, and the gate, tidy included, runs locally before a push. Name the stages that          \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m76\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  actually ran.  \u001b[29G             \u001b[43G        \u001b[52G           \u001b[64G   \u001b[68G       \u001b[76G   \u001b[80G    \u001b[85G    \u001b[90G   \u001b[94G    \u001b[99G   \u001b[103G     \u00