[0.043, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3Gbecause its starting station's\u001b[34Glife\u001b[39Gsupport\u001b[47Ghas\u001b[51Groom\u001b[56Gfor\u001b[60Gonly\u001b[65Gfour\u001b[70Gships.\u001b[77GSo\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Glarger\u001b[91Gworlds\u001b[98Gearlier\u001b[106Gestimates\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bguessed at couldn't be built or measured.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mCI\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BJettison \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m84b8eed\u001b[39m: builds \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclang-headless\u001b[39m with warnings as errors, then runs the smoke test on soft\u001b[103Gare Vulkan.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GManifest \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcdde5ab\u001b[39m: the environment\u001b[39Gcheck,\u001b[46Gthen\u001b[51Gthe\u001b[55Grelease\u001b[63Gbuild\u001b[69Gpackaged\u001b[78Gas\u001b[81Gthe\u001b[85Ginstall\u001b[93Gbundle,\u001b[101Gthen\u001b[106Gits\u001b[110Gsmoke\u001b[116Gtest\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gon the runner's Ub\u001b[24Gntu.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe\u001b[9Gfull gate, tidy included, now runs only locally before a push. That's\u001b[79Grecorded\u001b[88Gas\u001b[91GD-116,\u001b[98Gand\u001b[102Gthe\u001b[106Gdocs\u001b[111Gin\u001b[114Gboth\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Brepositories\u001b[18Gsay\u001b[22Gso.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNot done or not checked\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G- \u001b[1mPushes:\u001b[22m please push \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[38G\u001b[39min\u001b[41Gboth\u001b[46Grepositories.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCI:\u001b[9G\u001b[22mneither\u001b[17Gnew\u001b[21Gworkflow\u001b[30Ghas\u001b[34Grun\u001b[38Gon\u001b[41GGitHub\u001b[48Gyet.\u001b[53GThe\u001b[57GManifest\u001b[66Gsteps\u001b[72Gpassed\u001b[79Gwhen\u001b[84GI\u001b[86Gran\u001b[90Gthem\u001b[95Ghere,\u001b[101Gbut\u001b[105Gthe\u001b[109Gfirst\u001b[115Greal\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  run is still worth watching.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mCross-review:\u001b[22m I haven't started the Codex cross-review of Stage 5 (R01–R09), which normally follows when a stage\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  closes. Say if you\u001b[24Gwant\u001b[29Git.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mNot tested:\u001b[17G\u001b[22ma\u001b[19Gbackup\u001b[26Gisn't\u001b[32Gread\u001b[37Gback\u001b[42Gas\u001b[45Git's\u001b[50Gwritten,\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63G4\u001b[65GGiB\u001b[69Gsnapshot\u001b[78Glimit\u001b[84Gis\u001b[87Gonly\u001b[92Gtested\u001b[99Gat\u001b[102G1\u001b[104GKiB,\u001b[109Gand\u001b[113Gnothing\r\u001b[1B    was tested against a power cut. All three are recorded as left open.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3GThis is a good point to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[36G\u001b[39mor\u001b[39Gstart\u001b[45Ga\u001b[47Gfresh\u001b[53Gsession.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
