[0.023, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 144 \u001b[14G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;117;113;94m// already name what was written: the journal then refuses every later call with\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 145 \u001b[14G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;117;113;94m// std::logic_error, and the next opening finds which it was. Throws std::logic_error too for a\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/manif\u001b[27Gst/docs/history.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m4\u001b[22m l\u001b[16Gnes,\u001b[21Gremoved\u001b[29G\u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m39\u001b[12G\u001b[22mvariable\u001b[21Gor HOME (Jetti\u001b[36Gon's `ResolvePath`, one d\u001b[62Gr\u001b[64Gct\u001b[67Gry at a\u001b[75Gtime); and \u001b[87Go\u001b[89Gtest\u001b[94Gcut a snapshot's\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m0\u001b[12G\u001b[22mwrite\u001b[18Go\u001b[20G it\u001b[24G catalogue's off, which\u001b[48Gt\u001b[50Ge `host` \u001b[60Guite now does. Round\u001b[81G2 found each \u001b[95Gesolved and one\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 141 \u001b[22m more: provisioning made a principal whose ID was past that bound, so it could never act, and now\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 142 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mrefuses it as malformed.                                                                              \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m2\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mrefuses it \u001b[24Gs malformed. Round 3, aimed at what the first two had not exami\u001b[88Ged, found F7\u001b[101Gresolved and\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m3\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mtwo\u001b[16Gm\u001b[19Ge: making a def\u001b[35Gult place's\u001b[47Gdirectories chmo\u001b[64Gded an existing parent named\u001b[93Gthrough `new/..`,\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m4\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mnow normalised first; and one lo\u001b[45Gg `Advance` flushed and\u001b[69Gsn\u001b[72Gpshotted once at its end,\u001b[98Gnow\u001b[102Gat\u001b[105Geach\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 145 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mstep due on the way, as the journal suite's long advance against short ones shows.                    \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m6\u001b[12G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[12G\u001b[22m##\u001b[15GR09:\u001b[20GStage\u001b[26G5\u001b[28Gclosed\u001b[35G—\u001b[37G2026-11-25\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 148 \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Making \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+15\u001b[39m, reading \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, running \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m shell commands…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ tail -5 ../manifest/build/gate-stage5-revi\u001b[51Gw3.out\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
