[0.399, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 498 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mtrust boundaries, files and permissions, the documents against the code), since a stage's review      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 499 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mreads its own diff and misses a rule repeated in three places or a bound one module sets and another  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 500 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mignores. The script exits 0 for `approve`, 1 for `changes`.                                           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 501 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 502 \u001b[22m Codex runs with `workspace-write` (it builds and runs suites in `build/`) at reasoning effort\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m503\u001b[12G\u001b[22m`high`, since its own defau\u001b[40Gt is `non\u001b[50G`\u001b[52G It may not change\u001b[71Gthe\u001b[75Gsource\u001b[82Gtree.\u001b[88GThe\u001b[92Gscript\u001b[99Gcompares\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m504\u001b[12G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[16Gtree,\u001b[22Guncommitted\u001b[34Gwork\u001b[39Gincluded,\u001b[49Gbefore\u001b[56Gand\u001b[60Gafter,\u001b[67Gand\u001b[71Gdiscards\u001b[80Ga\u001b[82Greview\u001b[89Gthat\u001b[94Gchanged\u001b[102Git,\u001b[106Gso\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(AGENTS.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line, removed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 110 \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 111 \u001b[22m After the gate, Codex reviews\u001b[42Gthe\u001b[46Gchange\u001b[53Gadversarially\u001b[67Gwith\u001b[72G`scripts/cross-review.sh`\u001b[98G(a\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 112 \u001b[12G\u001b[22mbackground task, about\u001b[35Gten\u001b[39Gm