[0.012, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mYour new review rule\u001b[22m is in\u001b[30GJettison\u001b[39G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mc2be3ac\u001b[39m,\u001b[48Gnot\u001b[52Gyet\u001b[56Gpushed.\u001b[64G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcross-review.sh\u001b[80G\u001b[39mnow\u001b[84Gdefaults\u001b[93Gto\u001b[96Gthree\u001b[102Grounds.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/build-and-gates.md\u001b[27G\u001b[39mnow\u001b[31Gsays\u001b[36Gto\u001b[39Greview\u001b[46Ga\u001b[48Gstage's\u001b[56Gcommits\u001b[64Gwhen\u001b[69Git\u001b[72Gcloses.\u001b[80GWhen\u001b[85Ga\u001b[87Gmajor\u001b[93Gstage\u001b[99Gcloses,\u001b[107Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bwhole-codebase review follows, Jettison first, \u001b[51Ghen Manif\u001b[61Gst, aimed at concer\u001b[81Gs that cu\u001b[91G across stages. The\u001b[111Gmemory\u001b[118Gis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bupdated too. I read \"major st\u001b[33Gge\" as one of Manif\u001b[53Gst's developm\u001b[68Gt stage\u001b[76G; tell me if y\u001b[91Gu\u001b[93Gme\u001b[96Gn something larger.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BManif\u001b[9Gst's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[39m and Jettison\u001b[40G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mc2be3ac\u001b[39m \u001b[49Gre bo\u001b[55Gh ready to push. Shall\u001b[78GI push them?\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BThis i\u001b[10G a good point to\u001b[27Gstart a new session or \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GWorked for 1h 36m 56s · done 9:01 am\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mGoal: close Manifest's Stage 5 through Codex cross-review. All four rounds ran and every finding is fixed, with\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe gate passing, though round 4's fixes haven't been reviewed. Next: say whether I should push Manifest's \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3m`feature-base` and\u001b[22GJettison\u001b[33G`c2b\u001b[38G3ac`. (turn \u001b[51Gff recap\u001b[60G in /config)\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m/compact\u001b[39m                                                                                                              \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mrun another cross review\r\u001b[2C\u001b[5B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2mPress up to edit queued messages\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
