[0.099, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/manifest/docs/history.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m7\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lines\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 145 \u001b[22m step due on the way, as the journal suite's long advance against short ones shows. Round 4, the last\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 146 \u001b[22m the user allowed, found F9 resolved and F8 open where the world's and the backups' directories are\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 147 \u001b[22m made, the normalising fix wrong across a symlink (F10), and D-111 and build-and-gates stale (F11).\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 148 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mAll three were fixed after it\u001b[48;2;92;2;0m and not reviewed again\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m: every directory is made a component at a time,  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 149 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[48;2;92;2;0meach made private \u001b[48;2;61;1;0mthrough the path it was made by, and the documents say what is built.               \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m148\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mAll three were fixed after it: every directory is made a component at a time,\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m each made private\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m       \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m149\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mthrough the path it was made by, and the documents say what is built.\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m Round 5, which the user added,\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m  \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m150\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfound\u001b[18Gthem res\u001b[27Glved and three more: a world within its backups could be removed by the backup named   \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m151\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mas\u001b[15Gits dir\u001b[23Gc\u001b[25Gory is, and backups led into the world by a symlink after a directory made on the way    \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m152\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mpassed the check; both are refused, the check made again once the backups' directory is. And a        \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m153\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mdirectory\u001b[22Gmade\u001b[27Gand\u001b[31Gthen\u001b[36Gmade\u001b[41Gprivate\u001b[49Gstayed\u001b[56Gopen\u001b[61Gto\u001b[64Geveryone\u001b[73Gwhen\u001b[78Gits\u001b[82Gparent's\u001b[91Gflush\u001b[97Gbetween\u001b[105Gthe\u001b[109Gtwo\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 154 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfailed, so Jettison's `CreateDirectoriesDurably` makes it 0700 from the start (pin `459af99`).        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 155 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 156 \u001b[22m ## R09: Stage 5 closed — 2026-11-25\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 157 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[8B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
