[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5Gthe new directory 0700. Th\u001b[32G symlink path into the world is\u001b[64Grefused\u001b[72Gwith\u001b[77Gno\u001b[80Gidentity\u001b[89Gwritten,\u001b[98Gand\u001b[102Ga\u001b[104Gworld\u001b[110Ginside\u001b[117Gits\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbackups\u001b[13Gis\u001b[16Grefused.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mTwo more checks it was running:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- A symlink in\u001b[21G token file's path left the other file intact.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- It replac\u001b[17Gd the world's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249msnapshots\u001b[41G\u001b[39mdirectory\u001b[51Gwith a symlink to a folder \u001b[79Gutside. The server\u001b[98Gwrote\u001b[104Ga 474\u001b[110GKB snapshot\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B  through it, and the\u001b[27Gprobe's\u001b[35G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249moriginal_retained False\u001b[59G\u001b[39msuggests\u001b[68Gsomething\u001b[78Galready\u001b[86Gin\u001b[89Gthat\u001b[94Gfolder\u001b[101Gdidn't\u001b[108Gsurvive.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BI\u001b[7Ghaven't judged\u001b[23Ghe snapshots resu\u001b[41Gt. Planting a\u001b[55Gsymlink inside\u001b[70Gthe\u001b[74Gworld\u001b[80Gmeans\u001b[86Galready\u001b[94Ghaving\u001b[101Gaccess\u001b[108Gto\u001b[111Gits\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bprivat\u001b[12G dir\u001b[17Gctory, so I doubt it's a real finding,\u001b[56Gbut Codex\u001b[66Gnever wrote\u001b[79Gne up.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BMy\u001b[6Gsaved\u001b[12Gnotes\u001b[18Gsay\u001b[22Gnot\u001b[26Gto\u001b[29Greword\u001b[36Gthe\u001b[40Gprompt\u001b[47Gto\u001b[50Gget\u001b[54Gpast\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Gfilter\u001b[70Gwithout\u001b[78Gasking\u001b[85Gyou.\u001b[90GSo\u001b[93Ghow\u001b[97Gshould\u001b[104GI\u001b[106Ggo\u001b[109Gon?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1. Retry round 6 la\u001b[23Ger\u001b[26Gwith the same prompt.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2. Let m\u001b[13Greword the\u001b[24Gbrief to drop the\u001b[42G\"reach … through \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m..\u001b[39